{"text": "She struck another match. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And there was Grandmother. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bright and kind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Grandmother cried the little girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Please take me with you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the match goes out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You will disappear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like the warm stove. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Quickly she lit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All the other matches. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To keep Grandmother there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The light was brighter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than the sun at noon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Grandmother took her in her arms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they flew up together. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To a place. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With no cold and no hunger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On New Years morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> People found the little girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the corner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was very still. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a smile on her face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And burnt matches in her hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wanted to warm herself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> People said sadly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But no one knew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The beautiful things. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had seen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was with her grandmother now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she would never be cold again.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "u", "c", "k", " ", "a", "n", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "G", "r", "a", "n", "d", "m", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", "